WEBVTT

00:00:23.720 --> 00:00:27.520
Welcome to our Velvet Room.

00:00:28.310 --> 00:00:31.520
My name is Igor.

00:00:32.230 --> 00:00:35.400
I will be accompanying you
on your journey.

00:00:35.400 --> 00:00:37.530
My name is Margaret.

00:00:37.780 --> 00:00:41.240
Even familiar landscapes will
reveal a different kind of beauty

00:00:41.240 --> 00:00:43.790
if you change your viewpoint.

00:00:44.700 --> 00:00:50.710
Where these new encounters
and new bonds will lead you...

00:00:50.710 --> 00:00:53.920
Such dazzling golden days.

00:00:53.920 --> 00:00:58.090
I, too, look forward to
what I might behold.

00:02:44.310 --> 00:02:47.310
Yasoinaba Station

00:02:47.310 --> 00:02:50.610
Inaba Line
Bus Schedule

00:03:15.470 --> 00:03:17.800
Hey. You dropped this.

00:03:18.640 --> 00:03:19.970
Thanks.

00:03:20.220 --> 00:03:23.680
Whatever. All I did was pick it up.

00:03:25.520 --> 00:03:28.100
Hey there! Over here!

00:03:29.400 --> 00:03:32.230
Hey, you're better-looking
than your photo.

00:03:33.900 --> 00:03:36.990
I'll be looking after you.
I'm Dojima.

00:03:38.070 --> 00:03:39.280
I'm Yu.

00:03:39.490 --> 00:03:41.070
Nice to meet you.

00:03:41.070 --> 00:03:42.950
Yeah, likewise.

00:03:43.280 --> 00:03:45.370
I'm off-duty right now.

00:03:45.370 --> 00:03:49.250
I figured you'd be pretty wiped after
that long trip, so I came to pick you up.

00:03:54.710 --> 00:03:55.760
Hello.

00:03:58.590 --> 00:04:00.010
Hello!

00:04:07.180 --> 00:04:09.020
Welcome!

00:04:11.350 --> 00:04:13.020
Taking off somewhere?

00:04:13.020 --> 00:04:14.070
No,

00:04:14.070 --> 00:04:16.400
I just came by
to pick this one up.

00:04:16.400 --> 00:04:18.650
He just moved here
today from the city.

00:04:18.650 --> 00:04:20.780
Oh, yeah?
From the city, huh?

00:04:23.200 --> 00:04:24.530
Nice to meet you.

00:04:24.530 --> 00:04:25.910
Uh, right.

00:04:27.910 --> 00:04:29.500
Right back at you.

00:04:30.000 --> 00:04:31.920
Hey, are you in high school?

00:04:32.460 --> 00:04:36.250
A city kid like you must be shocked
by how boring this place is, right?

00:04:38.130 --> 00:04:40.220
If you've got time on your hands,

00:04:40.220 --> 00:04:42.140
how about working
part-time for us?

00:04:42.140 --> 00:04:43.680
Sure, I'll be sure to...

00:04:47.640 --> 00:04:50.350
...sure to keep
an open mind about it.

00:04:50.640 --> 00:04:53.350
Are you okay?
You don't look so good.

00:04:59.610 --> 00:05:02.610
For the next year,
this will be your home.

00:05:03.490 --> 00:05:07.080
It's not much, but think of it
as your own place and get comfy.

00:05:07.080 --> 00:05:09.120
Oh, but we have Junes!

00:05:09.500 --> 00:05:14.000
Every day's great at your Junes!

00:05:15.630 --> 00:05:19.960
Every day's great at your Junes!

00:05:22.010 --> 00:05:24.970
Anyway, from here on in
we're family.

00:05:25.300 --> 00:05:27.260
Once again, good to
have you here.

00:05:27.260 --> 00:05:28.510
Yes, sir!

00:05:29.680 --> 00:05:31.730
So you're a jock-type, huh?

00:05:36.480 --> 00:05:39.730
Yu Narukami

00:05:40.030 --> 00:05:43.240
Against my will, I'm going to
introduce a transfer student to you.

00:05:43.240 --> 00:05:48.280
He's a pitiful guy who's been exiled from the corrupt
city to the sticks, in the middle of nowhere.

00:05:48.280 --> 00:05:50.750
In other words, he's a fugitive!

00:05:50.750 --> 00:05:52.620
Who are you calling a fugitive?

00:05:53.290 --> 00:05:55.120
Wha-What the...?

00:05:55.330 --> 00:05:57.130
Hey, you!

00:05:58.460 --> 00:06:00.000
Nice to meet you.

00:06:00.000 --> 00:06:02.050
Wha-What the...?

00:06:02.050 --> 00:06:03.590
What?

00:06:06.680 --> 00:06:09.390
Oh, boy, that felt so good!

00:06:09.810 --> 00:06:11.060
I mean, that was amazing!

00:06:11.060 --> 00:06:13.390
Standing up to Morokin like that!

00:06:13.390 --> 00:06:15.020
Do you think you'll be okay?

00:06:15.020 --> 00:06:17.110
You think he'll put you
on his blacklist?

00:06:17.110 --> 00:06:19.570
You mean his rotten orange list?

00:06:19.570 --> 00:06:22.490
You might have landed
on that list, yeah.

00:06:22.490 --> 00:06:24.900
Well, they always taste
the best right before they rot.

00:06:24.900 --> 00:06:25.910
You said it!

00:06:25.910 --> 00:06:28.830
When they're totally ripe,
they're so sweet and awesome!

00:06:28.830 --> 00:06:32.330
But oranges actually rot
sooner than you'd think.

00:06:32.330 --> 00:06:35.330
I've heard from our hostess
how hard it is to get a shipment in.

00:06:35.330 --> 00:06:38.080
We're not really going on and on
about oranges, are we?

00:06:38.080 --> 00:06:41.630
I like oranges, too,
but nothing beats meat!

00:06:41.630 --> 00:06:45.470
If it were a rotten meat list,
I wouldn't mind landing on that!

00:06:45.470 --> 00:06:47.220
Oh, we're still talking about this.

00:06:47.220 --> 00:06:50.140
Eating rotten meat will
upset your stomach, Chie.

00:06:50.140 --> 00:06:52.350
Jeez, what kind of
discussion is this?

00:06:51.560 --> 00:06:53.350
Listen, I saw it! You know!

00:06:52.350 --> 00:06:54.930
It's about the fact that
meat tastes so good, right?

00:06:53.770 --> 00:06:57.400
My future soul-mate, it was
that anchorwoman, Ms. Yamano!

00:06:54.930 --> 00:06:56.730
That's it in a nutshell?

00:06:57.400 --> 00:06:58.650
For real?

00:06:58.940 --> 00:07:00.270
Oh, that?

00:07:00.520 --> 00:07:03.280
That's something everybody's
talking about right now.

00:07:03.570 --> 00:07:06.360
Have you ever heard of
the Midnight Channel?

00:07:11.740 --> 00:07:14.120
At midnight, on rainy nights...

00:07:14.120 --> 00:07:17.040
You're supposed to watch
a turned-off TV alone.

00:07:17.370 --> 00:07:21.460
And as you stare at the image
of your own face onscreen,

00:07:21.460 --> 00:07:24.550
somebody else starts to
appear - that's how it works.

00:07:24.960 --> 00:07:28.050
And supposedly, that
person is your soul-mate.

00:07:44.480 --> 00:07:46.070
I am thou...

00:07:46.780 --> 00:07:48.910
Thou art I...

00:07:48.910 --> 00:07:53.280
Thou art the one
who opens the door...

00:08:07.840 --> 00:08:10.550
What's going on here?

00:08:17.230 --> 00:08:19.640
Sorry, I have to help out at home.

00:08:18.600 --> 00:08:20.730
Come on, you had to be dreaming.

00:08:19.640 --> 00:08:21.730
Okay. See you tomorrow!

00:08:20.730 --> 00:08:22.940
Sticking your hand
inside a TV and all...

00:08:22.940 --> 00:08:24.980
It's just not possible, all right?

00:08:26.860 --> 00:08:27.780
No.

00:08:28.990 --> 00:08:30.530
That was no dream.

00:08:30.860 --> 00:08:34.950
If it is true, though, then
maybe if it were a huge TV,

00:08:34.950 --> 00:08:37.790
your whole body would
fit inside, right?

00:08:38.040 --> 00:08:40.370
A huge TV, huh?

00:08:42.330 --> 00:08:44.090
This should fit the bill.

00:08:45.710 --> 00:08:47.760
So you've got these
things on display, too.

00:08:47.760 --> 00:08:49.630
How much would
one set me back?

00:08:49.630 --> 00:08:52.340
Shall I enlighten you,
then, Miss?

00:08:52.340 --> 00:08:55.640
No, thanks, it'll just
drive me to despair.

00:08:58.470 --> 00:08:59.850
- Whaaat?
- Whaaat?

00:09:00.350 --> 00:09:02.100
You gotta be kidding me!

00:09:02.100 --> 00:09:03.900
It really went in!

00:09:03.900 --> 00:09:04.940
I'm going.

00:09:04.940 --> 00:09:06.440
Hold up, hold up, hold up!

00:09:06.440 --> 00:09:08.110
Go? Go where?

00:09:08.110 --> 00:09:09.240
As far as I can make it.

00:09:09.240 --> 00:09:11.240
What's with the hero act?

00:09:10.860 --> 00:09:15.620
LCD TVS
DVD Players

00:09:11.240 --> 00:09:13.620
Hey! Hold up a second!

00:09:32.550 --> 00:09:35.300
What is... this place?

00:09:35.600 --> 00:09:39.390
Don't tell me
we're inside that TV?

00:09:39.390 --> 00:09:41.810
B-But that's impossible...

00:09:41.810 --> 00:09:43.520
What should we do?

00:09:43.520 --> 00:09:45.150
How should I know?

00:09:45.150 --> 00:09:48.360
How should you know?
It's a TV from your store, right?

00:09:48.360 --> 00:09:50.940
Huh? But we're not the ones
who manufacture them!

00:09:50.940 --> 00:09:52.950
What's up with that?

00:10:03.820 --> 00:10:05.490
Are you sure you saw her?

00:10:05.490 --> 00:10:07.150
A girl, for Pete's sake?

00:10:07.150 --> 00:10:09.530
Yeah, she might
have wandered in.

00:10:09.530 --> 00:10:11.450
Then we'll have to
rescue her, right?

00:10:11.450 --> 00:10:15.290
Yeah, sure, but we don't know
where the exit is, either.

00:10:18.330 --> 00:10:20.130
What, you saw her?

00:10:29.970 --> 00:10:31.720
I don't see her, do you?

00:10:36.310 --> 00:10:37.850
Hey!

00:11:00.370 --> 00:11:02.130
Are we allowed to
just go inside?

00:11:02.130 --> 00:11:03.460
Don't ask me!

00:11:03.460 --> 00:11:05.000
Narukami-kun?

00:11:23.480 --> 00:11:25.520
What is this place?

00:11:32.320 --> 00:11:34.910
What the hell is this?

00:11:36.120 --> 00:11:40.460
Hey, hey, this is one
creepy place we're in!

00:11:41.460 --> 00:11:43.920
Hey, guys, do you hear that?

00:11:53.640 --> 00:11:57.970
What is that?
A monkey... no, a bear?

00:11:57.970 --> 00:11:59.270
Is it a beast?

00:11:59.270 --> 00:12:01.810
No wait, you really
think that's a beast?

00:12:01.810 --> 00:12:04.190
Wh-Who are you?

00:12:04.770 --> 00:12:06.480
It talked!

00:12:08.440 --> 00:12:09.900
I'm Yu Narukami.

00:12:10.690 --> 00:12:13.110
H-How do you do?

00:12:13.700 --> 00:12:16.030
Did you happen to see
a girl around here?

00:12:16.030 --> 00:12:18.620
Why are you talking to it?

00:12:18.910 --> 00:12:22.750
I haven't seen any girl.
Never mind that!

00:12:22.750 --> 00:12:25.000
You shouldn't be here!

00:12:25.000 --> 00:12:27.670
The Shadows... The Shadows!

00:12:27.960 --> 00:12:29.460
Shadows?

00:12:30.630 --> 00:12:33.300
Put these on and
get yourselves home!

00:12:33.630 --> 00:12:35.890
Actually, we'd love to go home,

00:12:35.890 --> 00:12:38.390
but we don't know how, okay?

00:12:38.390 --> 00:12:40.220
Guess it can't be helped!

00:12:40.220 --> 00:12:42.310
I'll show you the way, then!

00:12:42.890 --> 00:12:44.310
The fog...

00:12:51.400 --> 00:12:53.450
Th-They're here!

00:12:51.740 --> 00:12:53.450
What the hell?

00:13:08.460 --> 00:13:09.670
Satonaka!

00:13:09.920 --> 00:13:11.250
Are you all right?

00:13:17.180 --> 00:13:18.260
Seriously?

00:13:18.260 --> 00:13:20.390
We're goners!

00:13:24.390 --> 00:13:26.480
I am thou...

00:13:26.480 --> 00:13:28.400
Thou art I...

00:13:28.770 --> 00:13:31.400
When both my eyes are opened,

00:13:32.110 --> 00:13:33.780
Thou...

00:13:33.780 --> 00:13:36.110
The time is now!

00:13:36.610 --> 00:13:39.120
This... this voice...

00:13:42.830 --> 00:13:45.410
Wh-What's this?

00:13:49.580 --> 00:13:51.170
What's going on here?

00:13:52.000 --> 00:13:54.090
H-Hey, you...

00:14:05.390 --> 00:14:07.190
Persona!

00:14:32.500 --> 00:14:34.170
Wh-What the hell...

00:14:34.170 --> 00:14:35.710
...is this?

00:15:02.450 --> 00:15:04.370
What's happening here?

00:15:35.770 --> 00:15:36.820
Narukami?

00:15:38.740 --> 00:15:39.950
Izanagi!

00:16:51.480 --> 00:16:54.980
Wh-What the hell... is this?

00:16:55.150 --> 00:16:58.360
U-U-U-Unbelievable!

00:17:06.780 --> 00:17:09.740
Who are you, exactly?

00:18:58.380 --> 00:19:00.760
We've been waiting for you.

00:19:01.170 --> 00:19:08.310
Tonight, we'd like to introduce you to
a new resident who will spice up your journey.

00:19:09.470 --> 00:19:10.390
Marie?

00:19:10.390 --> 00:19:13.190
I know. I can hear you.

00:19:13.890 --> 00:19:15.440
Nice to meet you.

00:19:17.060 --> 00:19:21.400
Please excuse her.
This is Marie.

00:19:21.400 --> 00:19:23.570
Her soul is still very young...

00:19:23.570 --> 00:19:26.620
Shut up! Don't tell him
more than he needs to know!

00:19:28.740 --> 00:19:31.370
...as you can see.

00:19:31.700 --> 00:19:34.000
Her manners may leave
much to be desired,

00:19:34.000 --> 00:19:38.670
but as she's in training, kindly look
the other way, and forgive her rudeness.

00:19:39.090 --> 00:19:40.710
I don't get it.

00:19:40.710 --> 00:19:43.130
Idiot. I hate you.
You moron.

00:19:45.510 --> 00:19:48.640
What a handful she is,
acting like such a shrew.

00:19:48.640 --> 00:19:53.390
But the fact that she's here
is also necessary for you.

00:19:54.020 --> 00:19:57.350
This room is integral to your fate.

00:19:57.900 --> 00:20:01.280
In this room, nothing ever
happens without a reason.

00:20:01.280 --> 00:20:06.700
The place where you'll cross paths with those
who wander aimlessly, with scoundrels...

00:20:06.700 --> 00:20:10.490
Who knows what these
encounters will entail?

00:20:10.490 --> 00:20:15.290
Perhaps it is rude, but we,
too, are somewhat intrigued.

00:20:19.290 --> 00:20:23.010
I have a certain proposal for you.

00:20:25.800 --> 00:20:28.840
Although she came
here before you,

00:20:28.840 --> 00:20:33.430
it's not as though Marie has much
knowledge of the outside world.

00:20:34.220 --> 00:20:37.060
Therefore, if you have
no objections,

00:20:37.060 --> 00:20:41.400
please take her
outside of this room.

00:20:46.610 --> 00:20:50.780
You didn't have to force
yourself to bring me out here.

00:20:51.200 --> 00:20:54.120
I'm not forcing myself.
It's to thank you.

00:20:54.120 --> 00:20:55.370
For what?

00:20:55.370 --> 00:20:58.370
That letter... you picked it up
for me, remember?

00:20:58.370 --> 00:20:59.540
What are you talking about?

00:20:59.540 --> 00:21:00.460
At the station.

00:21:01.040 --> 00:21:02.210
You've lost me.

00:21:02.840 --> 00:21:04.800
You don't remember?

00:21:12.550 --> 00:21:16.230
Hey, by any chance,
were you inside the TV?

00:21:16.730 --> 00:21:18.850
I don't remember anything.

00:21:19.140 --> 00:21:22.730
About myself,
or anything, really...

00:21:23.270 --> 00:21:27.700
Before I knew it, I was in
that room, with nothing to do.

00:21:28.490 --> 00:21:32.280
And then that lady
told me to stay there.

00:21:32.280 --> 00:21:36.660
Even the name "Marie" was
something that she gave me.

00:21:36.950 --> 00:21:39.830
After all, it would be hard
to get by without a name, right?

00:21:40.920 --> 00:21:42.580
I see...

00:21:43.130 --> 00:21:46.380
Well, it's not like it's a problem
for me, so I could care less...

00:21:49.590 --> 00:21:53.390
Hey, where are we
headed, anyway?

00:22:04.730 --> 00:22:08.070
It's so spacious.
So this is outside...

00:22:08.070 --> 00:22:10.400
The world you live in.

00:22:11.320 --> 00:22:14.530
I wonder why...
It feels so nostalgic.

00:22:15.450 --> 00:22:18.160
It's nice, this kind of thing.

00:22:24.790 --> 00:22:26.300
Green leaves...

00:22:27.000 --> 00:22:28.800
They're flying away.

00:22:28.800 --> 00:22:31.680
Saying hello to the sky
and the clouds.

00:22:31.970 --> 00:22:34.600
I'm lost, and I'm flying away, too.

00:22:34.600 --> 00:22:38.180
To the moon in
the night sky... farewell.

00:22:45.150 --> 00:22:49.400
It's not what you think!
Th-That wasn't a poem or anything!

00:22:49.400 --> 00:22:52.320
I-I-It just happened to
pop into my head!

00:22:52.320 --> 00:22:54.450
That's right, that's all it was!

00:22:55.160 --> 00:22:57.120
That's really stylish, huh?

00:23:00.580 --> 00:23:03.210
Would you mind
not eavesdropping?

00:23:03.540 --> 00:23:06.840
Moron, I hate you.
Stylish... you suck.

00:23:17.180 --> 00:23:19.680
It feels good to be outside.

00:23:19.680 --> 00:23:21.640
It's so much better
than that room.

00:23:21.640 --> 00:23:25.650
It's so cramped in there, and
dark, and The Nose never talks.

00:23:25.650 --> 00:23:27.360
It's so suffocating...

00:23:27.360 --> 00:23:29.110
Well, that must be tough.

00:23:29.940 --> 00:23:33.610
I want to see more...
all kinds of things.

00:23:34.660 --> 00:23:36.620
Then I'll show you around.

00:23:37.780 --> 00:23:39.080
You'd do that?

00:23:39.080 --> 00:23:42.250
I did just move here
myself, but yeah.

00:23:43.410 --> 00:23:45.290
What is this?

00:23:45.580 --> 00:23:48.500
Why would you do that for me?

00:23:48.960 --> 00:23:50.750
I don't get it.

00:24:00.560 --> 00:24:03.600
Okay, I'm taking you up on that.

00:24:03.890 --> 00:24:07.900
That lady did say I could
go outside if I were with you.

00:24:08.650 --> 00:24:10.400
Consider it done.

00:24:12.360 --> 00:24:13.900
I'm counting on you.

00:24:18.410 --> 00:24:19.120
Big Bro!

00:24:19.120 --> 00:24:21.040
I'll avenge you, Senpais!

00:24:21.040 --> 00:24:21.790
Draw!

00:24:21.790 --> 00:24:23.330
What do those guys
think they're doing?

00:24:23.330 --> 00:24:24.460
Yahoo!

00:24:24.460 --> 00:24:25.620
Heckle, heckle!

00:24:25.620 --> 00:24:27.370
Hey! You're really
motivated, huh?

00:24:27.370 --> 00:24:28.790
I can't afford to lose!
